                    <death when="1815"/>
                    <occupation>Bookseller</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p> See Ed Pope: Robert Faulder bookseller 46 New Bond-st. James White DNB 1775-1820
                            married his daughter Margaret on 27.5.1811. Faulder was buried 21.7.1815
                            so the last entry above may have referred to his son Joseph who was
                            executor of his will along with James White.  Another son, Thomas, (baptised 8 December 1789) accounts for the T. Faulder entries in the Diary.  </p>
